WEBVTT

00:05:57.888 --> 00:06:00.624
female politicians suffer greatly,

00:06:00.657 --> 00:06:04.961
as our elections tend to value
likability over competency.

00:06:06.129 --> 00:06:09.165
Women hold only
25 percent of the seats in Congress.

00:06:10.066 --> 00:06:13.103
The competence/likability dilemma
has huge consequences,

00:06:13.136 --> 00:06:14.738
not just in politics,

00:06:14.738 --> 00:06:17.974
but also in education
and in the workplace,

00:06:18.008 --> 00:06:22.646
where studies show that women
in meetings with both genders

00:06:22.679 --> 00:06:24.981
are less likely to contribute knowledge.

00:06:24.981 --> 00:06:26.883
As women we're told to lean in,

00:06:26.917 --> 00:06:29.085
and yet there's backlash when we do.

00:06:29.819 --> 00:06:31.388
A recent study shows that women